  "description": "Stable, lightweight and strong.\n\nThe DK Flux LX 20” is designed for the purest form of BMX: Dirt. While it excels at high speeds and big airs, this top-tier build effortlessly transitions to the street or skatepark. Engineered around a spacious 21.25” top tube, stable geometry, and a longer rear end, the Flux LX delivers unmatched speed and control at any altitude. The double-butted chromoly frame is outfitted with proven aftermarket components, including DK Phase bars and forks, DK Social cranks, and a DK Chamberlain stem. Sealed bearings throughout keep maintenance low, while 110 PSI tires, chainstay-mounted brakes, and a trails-approved 28/10 gear ratio deliver a lightweight, custom-level ride right out of the box.",
